  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Demolishes 1,490,331 sq ft of commercial buildings and garages on 32.66 acres; North Block Retail (12.03 acres) remains; office and commercial buildings of eight to ten stories along El Camino Real",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City CEQA determination (June 30, 2026): the City found the project not sufficiently defined for a CEQA Guidelines 15183 streamlined review and found a project-level EIR the most appropriate review. It cites flexible land use on Blocks C5 and S2 (up to four scenarios), 3,500 to 4,500 jobs against 1,707 studied in the General Plan EIR, 10-story heights beyond General Plan limits, and a phasing plan likely to take at least 15 years to full buildout.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Project description (July 2026): Scenario 1, about 1,385 units, 1,371,857 sq ft office and 150,132 sq ft retail; Scenario 2, about 1,670 units, 1,059,193 sq ft office and 150,132 sq ft retail; about 4.5 acres of open space either way. Phases: South Block (S1 to S3) about 4 years, S4 about 2 years, Central Block about 8 years, timed by market conditions.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Holland & Knight (October 27, 2026) represents David Bohannon Company as applicant and HSC Property Owner LLC as owner; the application is a Master Development Plan and Vesting Tentative Map. Its April 30, 2026 letter lists APNs 039-490-170, 042-121-060 and 039-490-050 and refers to an earlier file, PA-2025-008.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002014",
        "SRC-002013"
      ]
    }
  ],
